    "updated_at": "2025-10-17T16:17:48Z",
    "body": "It seems like none of those browsers allow non-ASCII local parts. For the domain:\n\n- WebKit: no non-ASCII domains\n- Chrome: allows non-ASCII domains, but converts them to punycode (a-label)\n- Firefox: allows non-ASCII domains, and leaves them unconverted (not in punycode)",
